  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 760377,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 2 Games in 1 - Sonic Advance + Sonic Battle (Nintendo Game Boy Advance)\n\nRelive the thrill of two classic Sonic adventures with *2 Games in 1 - Sonic Advance + Sonic Battle* for the Game Boy Advance! This compilation brings together the vibrant platforming of *Sonic Advance* and the fast-paced arena battles of *Sonic Battle* onto a single cartridge.\n\n*Sonic Advance* sees Sonic and his friends – Tails and Knuckles – embarking on a quest to rescue Princess Sally and restore the kingdom of Mobius. Explore colorful zones, defeat Dr. Eggman’s robots, and master unique character abilities in this action-packed journey. \n\n*Sonic Battle*, developed by Sonic Team, throws you into a series of intense arena battles against a variety of enemies. Utilize Sonic’s signature speed and a diverse range of special moves to overcome challenging opponents and uncover the secrets behind a mysterious threat.\n\nDeveloped by Dimps Corporation and Sonic Team, and published by Sega and THQ, this double pack offers hours of gameplay, with a simple menu allowing you to easily switch between the two distinct experiences. A true celebration of the Sonic franchise!"
    },
